title: Evident
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Karmarti
    given-names: Souravamsee
    email: martisoura@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  Evident is a reference implementation and architecture for executable
  governance evidence. It defines an Evidence Graph intermediate
  representation and a rule-evaluation model that produces explainable,
  leveled findings without issuing legal or regulatory compliance verdicts.
keywords:
  - governance evidence
  - evidence graph
  - model risk
  - auditability
  - python
